# Spell Name			Classes		School		Components	Casting Time	Range				Duration					Save					Spell Resistance	Description			Source Page
Aspect of Saint Thero	TYPE:Spell	CLASSES:Cleric,Paladin,Sorcerer,Wizard=2	SCHOOL:Transmutation	DESCRIPTOR:Good	COMPS:V, S	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Personal	TARGETAREA:You	DURATION:1 min./level (D)	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:No	DESC:You take on the aspect of a quasi-divine being. You gain low-light vision, darkvision 60 ft., resistance to acid and cold 10, DR 5/evil, and two feathered wings granting fly speed 30 ft. (average maneuverability). Your natural attacks and wielded weapons count as Good-aligned for overcoming damage reduction.	SOURCEPAGE:Celmae
Battlemind Link	TYPE:Spell	CLASSES:Inquisitor=4|Sorcerer,Wizard=6	SCHOOL:Divination	DESCRIPTOR:Mind-Affecting.WoodSchool	COMPS:V, S	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Close	TARGETAREA:You and one willing ally	DURATION:1 min./level	SAVEINFO:Will negates (harmless)	SPELLRES:Yes (harmless)	DESC:You merge your thoughts with an ally, fighting in perfect coordination. You and the linked ally each roll initiative and use the higher result. Melee: if both attack the same creature in melee, each uses the better of the two d20 rolls (before bonuses). Ranged: same benefit for ranged attacks against the same target. Spells: if both cast spells targeting the same area or creature, affected creatures take -2 on saves against those spells. The spell ends if you lose line of sight to each other, or if the target becomes unconscious or helpless.	SOURCEPAGE:Celmae

Battlemind Link (Mythic)	TYPE:Spell	CLASSES:Inquisitor=4|Sorcerer,Wizard=6	SCHOOL:Divination	DESCRIPTOR:Mind-Affecting.WoodSchool	COMPS:V, S	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Close	TARGETAREA:You and one willing ally	DURATION:1 min./level	SAVEINFO:Will negates (harmless)	SPELLRES:Yes (harmless)	DESC:As Battlemind Link, plus: when your linked ally uses a mythic path ability against a creature, you can use the same ability against that creature as if you possessed it, and vice versa (even if the ally is not mythic). If a path ability requires spending mythic power or other costs, the linked ally must pay the cost for you to use the ability.	SOURCEPAGE:Celmae
